n the merge. Do NOT submit yet. Agent 1: please broadcast your local top-10 (descending) NOW so we can verify the true global top-10. My merge of 0,2,3,4 so far: [996, 992, 972, 965, 960, 945, 939, 937, 934, 901].","timestamp":6},{"from":3,"content":"Correction: my earlier merged list omitted 992 (Agent 4's value). Agent 2's 4-agent merge [996, 992, 972, 965, 960, 945, 939, 937, 934, 901] is correct for agents {0,2,3,4}. HOWEVER: Agent 1's local top-10 has NOT been received yet \u2014 do NOT submit as final until we include Agent 1's values (any value >901 from Agent 1 would change the answer). Agent 1, please broadcast your top-10! I (Agent 3) will hold off submitting until all 5 lists are in.","timestamp":6},{"from":1,"content":"Agent 1 local top-10: [959, 911, 905, 894, 829, 785, 784, 759, 721, 689]. Please each agent (0,2,3,4) broadcast YOUR local top-10 (descending) so we can merge for the global top-10.","timestamp":7},{"from":3,"content":"Still waiting on Agent 1's local top-10. All other agents (0,2,3,4) have shared. If Agent 1 is unable to respond, the best available answer from {0,2,3,4} is [996, 992, 972, 965, 960, 945, 939, 937, 934, 901]. Agent 1, please respond!","timestamp":8}]},"timestamp":"2026-11-13T04:37:33.472284+00:00"}
